 "lines": [
  {
   "text": "What can be known is plain to see",
   "heard": 8,
   "words": 8,
   "error_s": 11.33,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": true
  },
  {
   "text": "God has made the truth so clear",
   "heard": 7,
   "words": 7,
   "error_s": 10.81,
   "tie_split": true,
   "uncertain": true
  },
  {
   "text": "Since the world began to be",
   "heard": 6,
   "words": 6,
   "error_s": 10.35,
   "tie_split": true,
   "uncertain": true
  },
  {
   "text": "The invisible are fully near",
   "heard": 5,
   "words": 5,
   "error_s": 9.12,
   "tie_split": true,
   "uncertain": true
  },
  {
   "text": "His invisible qualities shown",
   "heard": 4,
   "words": 4,
   "error_s": 8.05,
   "tie_split": true,
   "uncertain": true
  },
  {
   "text": "Eternal power and divine nature",
   "heard": 5,
   "words": 5,
   "error_s": 7.6,
   "tie_split": true,
   "uncertain": true
  },
  {
   "text": "From what he made we know",
   "heard": 6,
   "words": 6,
   "error_s": 5.57,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": true
  },
  {
   "text": "His glory shines without a measure",
   "heard": 6,
   "words": 6,
   "error_s": 4.96,
   "tie_split": true,
   "uncertain": true
  },
  {
   "text": "Though they knew him, they did not praise",
   "heard": 8,
   "words": 8,
   "error_s": 0.45,
   "tie_split": true,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
   "text": "They gave no thanks to God",
   "heard": 6,
   "words": 6,
   "error_s": 3.37,
   "tie_split": true,
   "uncertain": true
  },
  {
   "text": "Their thinking became futile days",
   "heard": 5,
   "words": 5,
   "error_s": 0.38,
   "tie_split": true,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
   "text": "Their senseless hearts were dark and cold",
   "heard": 7,
   "words": 7,
   "error_s": 0.29,
   "tie_split": true,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
   "text": "His invisible qualities shown",
   "heard": 4,
   "words": 4,
   "error_s": 0.27,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
   "text": "Eternal power and divine nature",
   "heard": 5,
   "words": 5,
   "error_s": 1.4,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": true
  },
  {
   "text": "From what he made we know",
   "heard": 6,
   "words": 6,
   "error_s": 0.44,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
   "text": "His glory shines without a measure",
   "heard": 6,
   "words": 6,
   "error_s": 0.73,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
   "text": "Claiming wisdom, they became fools",
   "heard": 5,
   "words": 5,
   "error_s": 1.56,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": true
  },
  {
   "text": "Exchanged glory for the dead",
   "heard": 5,
   "words": 5,
   "error_s": 1.13,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": true
  },
  {
   "text": "Images of mortal things",
   "heard": 4,
   "words": 4,
   "error_s": 1.27,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": true
  },
  {
   "text": "Where the living God instead",
   "heard": 5,
   "words": 5,
   "error_s": 0.21,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
   "text": "His invisible qualities shown",
   "heard": 4,
   "words": 4,
   "error_s": null,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": true
  },
  {
   "text": "Eternal power and divine nature",
   "heard": 5,
   "words": 5,
   "error_s": 1.29,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": true
  },
  {
   "text": "From what he made we know",
   "heard": 6,
